	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseFleshbeast">
		<defName>Infector</defName>
		<label>Infector</label>
		<description>A necromorph born not to kill, but to continue. It does not hunt the living — it waits for them to become dead. Sliding through the dark on thin, unnaturally bent limbs, it finds fresh corpses, looms over the skull, and drives its proboscis into the base of the neck. Infected flesh is injected; bones break and fuse anew, skin stretches and splits, and a scream tears from the throat — a scream that no longer belongs to a human. A moment later, a new beast rises. And the Infector is already searching for the next corpse.\n\nKilling it is not enough. As long as there are dead, the infection will not stop.</description>
